# Release APK → prod mobile-pack

After any **release** Android build:

1. `scripts/build_apk.sh` (calls `scripts/publish_downloads.sh`) or run publish explicitly.
2. Upload target: `krl@karielan-hub:~/punzh-dict/mobile-pack/punzh-dict-latest.apk`
3. Public URL: `https://punzhina.krc.karelia.ru/mobile-pack/punzh-dict-latest.apk`
4. Also copy versioned APK/AAB into `store/rustore/` for store consoles (do not commit `*.apk` / `*.aab`).
5. Do **not** commit APK into the punzh-dict git repo `app/downloads/`.
